          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Our mission is to cultivate a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning within the field of computer science.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            We strive to provide every member with opportunities to develop technical skills, build professional networks, and contribute to projects that make a real impact in our community and beyond.
          </p>
          
